   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective for the Lot HUM partnership engagement is: Save lives and alleviate suffering through effectiveand timely needs-based assistance and accompaniment to local response initiatives in support of vulnerable persons,households and communities impacted by conflict or natural disaster. Interventions build on and strengthenbeneficiary and partner capacities to address vulnerabilities, enhance self-reliance and strengthen resilience to futureshocks</narrative>
